<main><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="index.html">HOME</a> / ACHIEVEMENTS</div><div class="eyebrow light"><span></span> MILESTONES & EXPERIENCE</div><h1>A track record built project by project</h1><p>Selected milestones and engineering achievements across process industries.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="notice" style="margin-bottom:22px">TEXOL’s experience includes process-plant design, pilot systems, reactor packages and collaborations with industrial and research organizations.</div><div class="fact-list"><article class="fact"><strong>01 / Achievement</strong><p>TEXOL states it has commissioned over 120 plants in India and abroad.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>02 / Achievement</strong><p>The company describes growth from a team of five in 2005 to a group of 60 professionals.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>03 / Achievement</strong><p>The company reports establishing TEXOL International FZC in Ajman, UAE.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>04 / Achievement</strong><p>Designed and supplied two recycle hydrocracker pilot plants to a Malaysian client.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>05 / Achievement</strong><p>Designed and supplied a hydrocracker with six reactors, including ATM and vacuum distillation, for an overseas Middle East client (March 2014).</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>06 / Achievement</strong><p>Supplied a high-pressure two-CSTR gas-to-liquid catalytic slurry reactor plant to BPCL, Noida (2010).</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>07 / Achievement</strong><p>NCL (CSIR) partnered with TEXOL for technology development and scale-up of lactic-acid downstream processing.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>08 / Achievement</strong><p>Supplied pilot plants for Dow Chemicals India Research Centre and Reliance Industries Refinery R&D Centre.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>09 / Achievement</strong><p>Designed and supplied a CE, PED and ATEX-compliant turnkey plant worth €2 million to a European client (February 2014).</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>10 / Achievement</strong><p>Supplied a lignocellulosic biomass-to-ethanol pilot plant to Indian Oil Corporation Ltd. in association with National Renewable Energy, USA.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>11 / Achievement</strong><p>Established in-house testing facilities including automated fixed/fluidized-bed catalyst testing, batch and continuous distillation, and CSTR units.</p></article><article class="fact"><strong>12 / Achievement</strong><p>Acquired VK Pump Industries Pvt. Ltd. in 2010, as part of the company’s reported history.</p></article></div><div class="page-cta"><h3>Certificates and company documents</h3><a class="button button-lime" href="downloads.html">Explore downloads <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-main"><a class="brand brand-footer" href="index.html"><span class="brand-mark">T<span>.</span></span><span class="brand-name">TEXOL<small>ENGINEERING</small></span></a><p>Customized process engineering.<br>Built around your process.</p><div class="footer-links"><a href="solutions.html">Capabilities</a><a href="industries.html">Industries</a><a href="projects.html">Projects</a><a href="gallery.html">Gallery</a><a href="key-persons.html">Key Persons</a><a href="achievements.html">Achievements</a><a href="energy.html">TEXOL Energy</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></div></div><div class="container footer-bottom"><span>© <span class="year"></span> TEXOL Engineering.</span></div></footer><script is:inline src="/Texol_demo/script.js"></script>

